{"id": "unknown-2026-11-07-011", "date": "2026-11-07", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 45, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Harbinger scores another $240M in latest investment round", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/11/harbinger_EV.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Electric truck maker Harbinger has been racking up wins in recent months, and after scoring a $300 million order from international shipping giant FedEx and a defense contract with the US military, the company has drummed up another $240 million in Series D funding.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-p", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/11/07/harbinger-scores-another-240m-in-latest-investment-round/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-07-012", "date": "2026-11-07", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 45, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["expand"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Yamaha’s new electric scooter takes aim at Europe’s 125cc commuters", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/11/XENTER-E-yamaha-electric-scooter-charging-header.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Yamaha is expanding its electric scooter lineup with the new XENTER E, a 125cc-equivalent electric scooter designed specifically with European city riding in mind.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategory=\"electric-motorcycle,electric-scooter,yamaha\" data-laye", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/11/07/yamahas-new-electric-scooter-takes-aim-at-europes-125cc-commuters/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-07-013", "date": "2026-11-07", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 45, "weekday": "Sat"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["industry_general"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Honda just showed off its first high-end electric mountain bike", "content": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://electrek.co/wp-content/uploads/sites/3/2026/11/honda-rn0-electric-mountain-bike-header.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Honda makes just about everything with a motor, from lawnmowers and generators to cars, motorcycles, and even airplanes. Now the Japanese giant is adding another electrified vehicle to the list – a premium electric mountain bike.</p>\n\n\n\n <a data-layer-pagetype=\"post\" data-layer-postcategor", "sources": [{"name": "electrek", "url": "https://electrek.co/2026/11/07/honda-just-showed-off-its-first-high-end-electric-mountain-bike/", "type": "rss"}]}
